{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is a demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep in mind the version of the game you are playing here is a demo version, which includes 8 decks with more in the full version. I'm currently cooking up a full version that you can wishlist now! The full version will be done soon\u2122</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2660\u2664\u2665\u2661\u2663\u2667\u2666\u2662\u2660\u2664\u2665\u2661\u2663\u2667\u2666\u2662-------------------------------------------------\u2660\u2664\u2665\u2661\u2663\u2667\u2666\u2662\u2660\u2664\u2665\u2661\u2663\u2667\u2666\u2662</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a new twist to the classic Spider Solitaire in\u00a0<strong>Pokitaire</strong>! Turning this classic puzzle game into a score chasing arcade puzzle game with this solitaire and poker hybrid. Clear cards by playing poker hands instead of simply sorting them and chase highscores instead of only clearing cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787840/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1750614472\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See how this twist gets thoroughly explored with more than a dozen decks, all with their own twist and rules. Some twists are minor, some major, but all will require you to approach each deck with a different eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787840/extras/Ghost_Cards.gif?t=1750614472\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play impressive poker hands by going beyond the poker night table and discover the many definitely illegal poker hands. Discover them to give you an edge or discover them for your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787840/extras/Hands_Collection.gif?t=1750614472\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787840/extras/Straight.gif?t=1750614472\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3787840?t=1750614472","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787840/e1c68a19ca8ad181378bfb8475447c27c74d6fc3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750614472","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787840/408b3e23f6e3d1d3edf4e2d9e393a73d13e39175/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750614472","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787840/408b3e23f6e3d1d3edf4e2d9e393a73d13e39175/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750614472","categories":[{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is a demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep in mind the version of the game you are playing here is a demo version, which includes 8 decks with more in the full version. I'm currently cooking up a full version that you can wishlist now! The full version will be done soon\u2122</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2660\u2664\u2665\u2661\u2663\u2667\u2666\u2662\u2660\u2664\u2665\u2661\u2663\u2667\u2666\u2662-------------------------------------------------\u2660\u2664\u2665\u2661\u2663\u2667\u2666\u2662\u2660\u2664\u2665\u2661\u2663\u2667\u2666\u2662</p><p 